192w|n|The opening or space inclosed by the threads of a net between knot and knot, or the threads inclosing such a space; network; a net. ; The engagement of the teeth of wheels, or of a wheel and rack.	a:12yo,88,9;26le,51,3;17zj,41,5;m4,34,3;21y2,32,4;1uus,25,3~12yo,88,9;17zj,41,5;21y2,32,4;m4,34,3;26le,51,3;1uus,25,3	v:1q0g,44,3;1rct,29,4~1rct,29,4;1q0g,44,3	n:23jm,60,3;120g,47,4;17zj,34,3;1rct,9,1;6r5,0,5~6r5,0,5;120g,47,4;23jm,60,3;17zj,34,3;1rct,9,1	N:26lg,94,7;ugz,51,3;ix3,48,3;n1t,47,2;pad,39,8;htb,39,5;15x2,38,11;rqc,23,5;6r5,19,19;1dce,19,3~6r5,19,19;15x2,38,11;pad,39,8;26lg,94,7;1gm9,13,5;rqc,23,5;htb,39,5;1dce,19,3;ugz,51,3;ix3,48,3
